'''Super Tower Defense''' is a cross-platform [[Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Game worlds|game world]] published by {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_4c72bdb3-8ee6-47b4-8167-73506dc4bc2b|DragonCookie}}. Players place towers to stop cars from reaching a pile of hearts.

== Layout ==

Players spawn beside a track. Cars follow the track toward a pile of hearts at the far end. A shop holds the six base towers as pickups. A wrench and a hammer hangs next to the tools board. A Next Wave button sits on the course.

Boards cover how to play, limitations, and credits. An achievement board and a cosmetic shop sit nearby. Toggle Tower View opens a camera pointed at the course.

== Gameplay ==

A run starts with 4,500 money and 10 hearts. Cars that reach the hearts remove lives. Extra hearts can be bought. The Next Wave button starts each round. After 50 rounds the game is won. The button then reads Continue Endless. It can also read Reset.

Towers are picked up from the shop and placed on the map. A placed tower cannot be moved. Hitting a tower with the wrench opens its upgrade. Hitting it with the hammer sells it for 90% of the buy price. Some upgrades also cost hearts. At most 25 towers can be placed. Toggle Auto Start starts waves without a press.

Achievements are disabled for players who join after wave 5.

